[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17042.23, "timestamp": "04:44:02", "text": "下一个点赞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17047.31, "timestamp": "04:44:07", "text": "呃，比如说卡利奥普·莫里，对吧，莫里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17049.948, "timestamp": "04:44:09", "text": "可以是一个常见的名字，会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17053.07, "timestamp": "04:44:13", "text": "人们认为莫里是对的，但是是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17057.47, "timestamp": "04:44:17", "text": "如果你有 Mor calop 没有权利，那就不能有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17060.47, "timestamp": "04:44:20", "text": "叫莫尔卡洛普，你只是个提醒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17069.83, "timestamp": "04:44:29", "text": "善用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17072.788, "timestamp": "04:44:32", "text": "姓名和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17076.55, "timestamp": "04:44:36", "text": "还有，嗯……你管它叫什么？你的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17080.27, "timestamp": "04:44:40", "text": "旅程你应该让它如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17083.43, "timestamp": "04:44:43", "text": "嗯嗯，我们说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17086.868, "timestamp": "04:44:46", "text": "嗯，什么时候？该怎么称呼它？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17090.55, "timestamp": "04:44:50", "text": "有人问起你，他们会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17094.788, "timestamp": "04:44:54", "text": "必须立刻……嗯，想出一个主意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17096.55, "timestamp": "04:44:56", "text": "他们正在和这个人说话，他们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17098.83, "timestamp": "04:44:58", "text": "谈论这件事"}]